   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 13,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "حصة الشريك أو المساهم",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "1c30890055005583f231d2964b0fbcceecf274b38331552d902937c75022419d",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "c2e19bcb994cc40868e9574e3a2efa5cdafdef424fb88bf5387e85da2641e827",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-013",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "cce0ee0788092062efd384a7ea86ae07b38b578e742e4dbabce09d7cb808b50e",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "合伙人或股东的出资可以是现金、实物，或两者兼有。\n除股份公司和简易股份公司外，合伙人的出资可以是劳务，以换取公司设立合同所确定比例的利润分成；但其出资不得为其所享有的声誉或影响力。\n惟有现金出资和实物出资构成公司资本。\n发起人、合伙人或股东可以将公司资本中的出资或股份给予某人，作为其从事有利于公司并实现公司目标的工作或服务的对价，但不得违反本法规定。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "354b05f258c7a65a9638c386e91d5b392fada2928865203090feb18e2ac5cf38",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 14,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "تقديم الحصة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "69dd0534d397873225211d6d7c0e2913f82464c7da3f0c8b7a5b2ba71615b538",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "987bc8a5fa64699f9dc5fae732dae25504fa854326de6c370aab13e57589c273",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-014",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "3b32cfea7f4ef95c3dd0b6e44997efd69eb015b32f6df46846bafb223746498c",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "若合伙人或股东的出资为所有权、用益权或任何其他物权，则其应依照买卖合同的规定，就出资灭失时的担保、以及就出资被追夺、权利主张或出现瑕疵或短缺承担担保责任；若其出资仅为对某项财产的个人使用权益，则适用租赁合同的规定；但另有约定的除外。\n若合伙人的出资为劳务，则其应完成所承诺的工作，该工作所产生的一切收益归公司所有，且其不得为自己利益从事该项工作。但除另有约定外，其无义务向公司提供因该工作而取得的知识产权。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "315975cdd370ec176142121482d45cdda37337bbe971e6189ada42339faa1197",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 15,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "التأخر في تقديم الحصة",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "29cd3d81a7397049bbf5324068ddb02c8d3308c3eaf03908d2e4513b9e8a6cfd",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "9ad49a272bb071d12456c3dc693feaea35cdb92b2e8bd3b31252ce067cf15bbd",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-015",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "ed081b478b5e7230486b8262da5fa7570d3c78597983e85a15f16b12e4ab4827",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "每一合伙人均为其对公司所承诺出资的债务人。\n若合伙人逾期未在规定期限内缴纳其在公司资本中的出资，公司可要求其履行对公司的承诺，或中止与其出资相关权利的效力，如获取利润的权利，或在股东大会上或对合伙人决议的表决权；在任何情况下，公司均保留就由此产生的损害要求其赔偿的权利。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "d988449027ba7b96fac5fdb68ec517fd99c26a884a2022e4d9760abb9c3a9a6d",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 17,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "السجلات المحاسبية والقوائم المالية",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "bcf44f28a55ca7908c720e2db8ccd6674f0a2af7fe7f74d728ac011f42b18b95",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "b079286846c283632a12d5101046b175c1bedbaadca97ad846b4f1f95c552d69",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-017",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "75b61b5110010f824f54460e05b83cddc4215106f79a77789ba0d893173183e4",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "公司应在其主要中心（总部）、或公司经理或董事会指定的任何其他地点，保存会计记录及其支持性凭证，以说明其业务、合同和财务报表。\n应在每一财政年度终了时，依照王国采用的会计准则编制公司财务报表，并依照实施条例的规定，在财政年度结束之日起（六）个月内提交该等报表，均依照本法所载规定办理。\n若编制期中或年度财务报表需要控股公司、或在另一公司资本中持有出资或股份的公司，从被控股公司、或被持有资本出资或股份的公司获取信息，则后者应在使控股公司或持股公司能够依照王国采用的会计准则编制其财务报表的限度内，提供该等信息。\n资本市场管理局可就在资本市场上市的股份公司提供本条第（三）款所述信息制定规则。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "108d3677ea21b352c940299f2857db3e233a608ff6f7c0e2c680afebc2147b31",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 18,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "تعيين مراجع حسابات الشركة وعزله واعتزاله",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "d6e691354063bb720c20a7791953cfe797dfeeaf1270017f27587eb6855f5ea9",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "408f7d47afe08472327c61d98f5a20287c422715c3fd21dc90970886c8a6c04f",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-018",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "4f50b76f4277d61e03648aeb751d855a92084ec8a61050151c8bd67c4bbc1284",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "公司应有一名（或多名）在王国持牌的审计师，由合伙人、股东大会或股东（视情形而定）予以委任，并确定其报酬、任期和工作范围，且可再次委任。实施条例应确定个人审计师、审计公司及其负责审计的合伙人的最长工作期限。\n合伙人、股东大会或股东（视情形而定）可以罢免审计师，但不影响审计师在有正当理由时就其所受损害获得赔偿的权利。公司经理或董事会主席应在罢免决定作出之日起不超过（五）日内，将罢免决定及其理由通知主管机关。\n审计师可以书面通知公司辞去其职务，其职务自提交通知之日、或其在通知中确定的其后日期起终止，但不影响公司在有正当理由时就其所受损害获得赔偿的权利。辞任的审计师在提交通知时，应向公司和主管机关提交一份说明其辞任理由的陈述；公司经理或董事会应召集合伙人或股东开会、或召开股东大会（视情形而定），以审议辞任理由并委任另一名审计师。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "ad285044233434d5d450cc9c3cab13268c8e314c102f0dd7d54b73230e1f5ebd",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
   "official_chinese_translation_claimed": false,
   "chinese_binding_claimed": false,
   "chinese_governing_claimed": false,
   "source_basis": "official_source_based",
   "repository_legal_review_status": "repository_owner_review_active",
   "external_legal_review_status": "not_performed",
   "translation_basis": "official_arabic_governing_text",
   "english_guidance_role": "secondary_guidance_only",
   "source_status_before": "isolable_candidate_materially_incomplete_or_condensed",
   "remediation_action": "retranslate_internal_chinese_from_arabic",
   "qa_status": "pending_future_qa"
  },
  {
   "article_number": 19,
   "bab": 1,
   "article_title_ar": "عدم سريان متطلب تعيين مراجع حسابات",
   "arabic_source_file": "data/official_arabic_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_arabic_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "arabic_source_hash_sha256": "ab96b968d66c2189b3af105a5dc7e64a602e27a863c6dd00fec6503ae03f58c1",
   "english_guidance_file": "data/official_english_legal_llm/companies_law_m132_1443_official_english_legal_llm_001_281.json",
   "english_guidance_hash_sha256": "0e78dbec5bb5878e0705ed6f05092699540493c969df629b7dfe207e9c779fd1",
   "prior_candidate_record_id": "zh-int-companies-art-019",
   "prior_candidate_hash_sha256": "d7778ca3e269383cd5ef50b43a91861ebfcece8b547b3c6e4668e2a913db82bf",
   "qa_priority": "P1",
   "qa_recommended_action": "retranslate_from_arabic_before_full_chinese_layer",
   "remediated_chinese_text": "本法第（十八）条关于强制委任审计师的规定，不适用于微型和小型公司，但下列微型和小型公司除外：\n- （一）其设立合同或章程对此有规定的。\n- （二）在资本市场上市的。\n- （三）发行可交易的债务工具或融资凭证（苏库克）、优先股或可赎回股的。\n- （四）依照相关法律须委任审计师的。\n- （五）外国公司。\n- （六）拥有另一公司或从属于另一公司的，但所有该等公司均符合微型或小型公司描述者除外。\n为适用本款，实施条例应确定据以将公司描述为微型或小型公司的标准。\n本条第（一）款所载规定的适用，以公司在其于商业登记机关登记后的第一个财政年度内、或在连续两个财政年度内符合微型或小型公司的描述为条件。\n在适用本条第（一）款规定的公司中，代表其具表决权的出资或股份至少（百分之十）的一名或多名合伙人或股东，可以书面请求公司依照实施条例所确定的规则委任审计师。\n本法第（十八）条关于强制委任审计师的规定，不适用于无限公司，但下列情形之一者除外：\n- （一）其全体合伙人均为采取无限公司以外任何公司形式的法人。\n- （二）其全体合伙人均为采取无限公司形式的法人，且该等公司的合伙人为采取无限公司以外任何公司形式的法人。\n- （三）公司设立合同规定委任审计师的。",
   "remediated_chinese_text_hash_sha256": "11c202e6d53b478b3c1226e1733706c4922fc6d17d64a1e766a6b1f758daf952",
   "internal_reference_only": true,
